	)
	(text "+-1% Tolerance\nNominal: 1.5M + 20k divider, ratio of 0.013158\n140 * 0.013158 = 1.8421\n\nHighest reading: 1,485,000 (min) + 20,200 (max), ratio of 0.013419\n140* 0.013419 = 1.8787 (+1.99%)\n\nLowest reading: 1,515,000 (max) + 19,800 (min), ratio of 0.012900\n140 * 0.012900 = 1.8060 (-1.96%)"
